body:
@ilyavolodin 

> it's not really shadowing anything (same scope as built-in Promise)

That's not true. Top-level lexical declarations in modules shadow bindings in the global scope (see [ES2015 §15.2.1.16.4](http://www.ecma-international.org/ecma-262/6.0/index.html#sec-moduledeclarationinstantiation) step 6). `no-shadow` should catch those. Top-level _vars_ are just redeclarations of globals.
